==Strategy==
Before going in, it is recommended you have every Anti-Starred Alien Treasure, as the Shibaliens can tear apart your units. Wild Doge here is only at 100% magnification, so it isn't a threat. Courier Cat can take on this Wild Doge. The strategy is slightly the same, but spamming meatshields could trigger Li'l Doge's Dodge ability, which can make the battle go longer.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]], this stage was named Cats Warmly Battling, however, with the addition of a fourth stage to Snow Doges, the previous stage's name was changed to Snow Falls Forevermore and this stage received Snow Falls Forevermore's previous name.

